.el .ds Aq '
.TH devin-plugins-info 1  "info " 
.SH NAME
devin\-plugins\-info \- Show a plugin\*(Aqs skills, hooks, rules, and its required/optional/forbidden lists
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdevin plugins info\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show a plugin\*(Aqs skills, hooks, rules, and its required/optional/forbidden lists
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
The installed plugin name (or a disambiguated `owner/repo` label when several installed plugins share the same name)
